    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0095" n="585" xml:id="pg585"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    S/S–NSC Files:
                    Lot 63D351: NSC 14 Series</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Report to the President by the National Security
                        Council</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        NSC 14/1</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-07-01">July 1, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Note by the Executive Secretary on the Position of
                        the United States With Respect to Providing Military Assistance to Nations
                        of the Non-Soviet World</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Reference: NSC 14<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d27-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>At its 14th Meeting,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d27-f2"/> the National Security Council
                    considered a draft report on the above subject (NSC 14) and adopted it in the revised form enclosed herewith.</p>
                <p>The National Security Council recommends that the President approve the
                    Conclusions contained herein and direct that they be implemented by all
                    appropriate Executive Departments and Agencies of the US Government under the
                    coordination of the Secretary of State.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d27-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sidney</hi> W. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Souers</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Executive Secretary</hi>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d27-a1.xml" xpointer="d27-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d27-f1" n="1" xml:id="d27-f1-content">
                <p>A Report by the Executive Secretary, June 14, 1948, not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f2" n="2" xml:id="d27-f2-content">
                <p>July 1, 1948.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f3" n="3" xml:id="d27-f3-content">
                <p>The conclusions were approved by the President on July 10, 1948.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
